<title>SINGAPORE: HTP Holdings six months net up 81 pct.</title>
<headline>HTP Holdings six months net up 81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  3.06	  vs     1.69</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)		 1.90	  vs     1.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			   27.79	  vs    17.13</p>
<p>    Investment income		 2.86	  vs     2.48</p>
<p>    Other income			1.50	  vs     1.53</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  0.88	  vs     0.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    4.22	  vs     2.39</p>
<p>    Tax				   1.16	  vs     0.70</p>
<p>Note - HTP Holdings Ltd is a diversified investment company with property interests.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
